WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.320
If something feels off, log it on the side
effects tab.

00:04.680 --> 00:09.560
Tap Log side effect, add the symptom and the
severity, then save.

00:10.220 --> 00:12.120
Your notes stay in one list.

00:12.580 --> 00:14.620
Share them with your prescribing doctor.

